- The test harness (runner) expected to load [38;5;10mlibmemchra2_lib.so[0m (matching the case directory name [38;5;10mmemchra2_lib[0m)[0m[0m
- Since the [38;5;10m.so[0m file didn't exist at the expected path, every test vector failed with a [38;5;10mDlOpen[0m error[0m[0m
[0m[0m
